The '''Friend Referral Campaign''' (友達招待キャンペーン, ''?'', '''?''') is a campaign that appears when players create their account. After seven days has passed, the invite code entry screen will appear and allow players to input codes shared by other players. Depending on how many players are invited, the inviting players can obtain up to 1 [[Platinum Ticket]], 600 [[Cat Food]] and 6 [[Rare Ticket]]s, meanwhile new players can obtained 1 Platinum Ticket and 5 Rare Tickets.

